---
/**
 * This component sends ~4KB of invisible whitespace to force Vercel's edge 
 * to flush the current stream buffer. This ensures that the head and 
 * initial layout (like skeletons) are delivered to the browser immediately, 
 * even if subsequent components are delayed.
 */
---
{/* 4096 spaces to fill the buffer */}
{Array.from({ length: 4096 }).map(() => ' ')}
